 of work for insomniac to  add legs to general free-roaming in the  game but I believe those extra legs will  be there as part of an attack or maybe a  fall animation allowing Peter to land  safely it really would be a shame not to  see those extra limbs but don't hold  your breath on that one next up is the  velocity suit revealed at comic-con 2018  this costume is completely new and  designed for the game by acclaimed comic  book and film costume designer ad  Granoff his work is simply sublime as a  name implies the velocity suit will  enable us to move around the city with  more speed the suit looks damn good with  metallic paneling and the best bit is  seen when the lights are low glowing  spider-man insignias oh and his eyes too  so damn cool  so those were the pre-order instant  unlocks but that's only the beginning  let's quickly talk about the classic  suit this is the suit we'll be starting  the game with and as you'd expect it's a  nod to the og spider-man suit from the  amazing adult fantasy comic book first  seen in issue 7 back in 1961 by issue 15  spider-man was on the front cover the  ability this suit offers is a damage  boost after hitting a combo to signify  this Spidey's hands will glow it has  been said that a four times damage  multiplayer can be built up in combat as  it supposedly spider-man's first fully  formed suit it won't have tech  advantages like the iron spider or  themed attacks like the spider punk suit  it's here to be minimalist clean  functional and a nod to his humble  beginnings we won't be in that suit for  long though as the advanced suit will  quickly become our base model a lot of  people refer to it as the white spider  suit so I'll use both names the advanced  suit is the main costume we've seen in  almost all coverage around spider-man  ps4's reveal and it's a completely  original design by insomniac the games  developers they broke down the suit in  an interview over on Game Informer but  the main talking point to take from the  suit are the materials used to create it  the typical boot Spidey once wore have  been replaced with running shoes  different materials are used to allow  for additional mobility whereas the red  parts seem to offer more support and  padding this shows how Peters design  skills have developed over the years  this leads on perfectly to another suit  we've only seen for a split second on  Peter's phone did you catch it  yeah the homemade suit in spider-man  homecoming we went back in their history  books to relive the homemade suit it's  one of the most iconic costumes aside  from the classic or the black suit  versions of Spidey  everything is super cheap and customized  from Starke clothing but check out those  eyes top tier costume design as a bonus  to the homemade suit did you notice the  poster behind Peter it's a wrestling  advertisement from shortly after Peter  discovered his abilities soon after that  he saw a sign offering $100 to any  person that could stay in the ring with  crusher Hogan when he showed up in this  terrible outfit most people laughed but  as the masked marvel he won the cash the  character model in the ps4 version looks  very different but it looks complete so  I fully expect to see the luchador  inspired outfit  in spider-man on ps4 and finally the  spider-man noir suit has been confirmed  by a Game Informer's coverage but  without any details therefore the  ability is still unknown we can take a  guess at it by looking back at noir  suits history written back in 2009 but  set in the 1930s an alternative  spider-verse introduced this design  which swapped Peters wall-climbing  ability with guns  yes spider-man carries guns in this  universe the story is set during the  Great Depression era where Peter Parker  stumbles across this godlike spider  which gives him his new spider abilities  in this universe spider-man is once  again tracking down Norman Osborn who  killed his Uncle Ben in this world it's  uncertain what ability this 